OL,3,GNEWSAPlumber denies sexually assaulting
OL,4,Acustomers in homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plumber accused of hugging, picking
OL,7,Fup and touching female customers in
OL,8,Ftheir homes has denied sexually
OL,9,Fassaulting them.
OL,11,FNigel Rowley, 65, of Wordsworth Road in
OL,12,FDaybrook, Nottinghamshire, is charged
OL,13,Fwith 12 counts of sexual assault
OL,14,Fagainst five different women.
OL,16,FHe is accused of hugging, picking up
OL,17,Fand touching them over and under their
OL,18,Fclothing while he was working as a
OL,19,Fplumber and heating engineer in
OL,20,FEdwalton and Keyworth between September
OL,21,F2024 and September 2025.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
