OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a seven-minute court hearing at
OL,7,FNottingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,8,FFriday, District Judge Sunil Khanna
OL,9,Fheard Rowley indicates not guilty pleas
OL,10,Fto the charges against him.
